# WebSocket libraries - DoS vulnerability
# See: https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-48779
# Impact: Denial of Service via memory exhaustion from small WebSocket fragments
# Affected packages: ws, socket.io
# Current versions: ws@8.20.1, socket.io@4.8.3
# Mitigation: ws package upgraded to 8.21.0 or later
